    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Many letters have come from Rajnagar and Rajasthan in this connection; as you have said it seems some fruitful work has been accomplished by going there.",
      "path": "audio/1963-11/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 10.185193
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "One thing is very clear: people are eager for a spiritual life and current forms of religion do not satisfy them.",
      "path": "audio/1963-11/12.mp3",
      "start": 11.571474,
      "end": 19.972268
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "If however the right religion is given to them it can revolutionize human consciousness.",
      "path": "audio/1963-11/13.mp3",
      "start": 21.516961,
      "end": 27.633288
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I think of you.",
      "path": "audio/1963-11/14.mp3",
      "start": 29.157846,
      "end": 30.322494000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "May God grant you peace.",
      "path": "audio/1963-11/15.mp3",
      "start": 32.016871,
      "end": 33.879296999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "My love and regards to all.",
